# Deny everything, then allow only what the image actually needs.
# This ordering guarantees that face photos, reports, checkpoints and other
# local data can never leak into the build context (and therefore the image),
# even if new files appear in the repo later.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!skin_metrics/

# ...minus build cruft inside the allowed source tree.
skin_metrics/**/__pycache__/
skin_metrics/**/*.py[cod]
skin_metrics/**/*.task
